  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s9/462b3ee3> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s9/462b3ee3> ;
  triage:notes "USER MANDATE: Any eventual fix must be fully isolated behind a trait or small set of traits for remote-send routing, must NOT spread through daemon code generally, and must NOT touch crates it doesn't belong in. This finding is explicitly deferred to a dedicated future sprint and must NOT be dispatched in this batch regardless of dispatch_ready computation. Fix dispatch is blocked pending user authorization for a dedicated future fix sprint." .

